rt":925,"end":1129,"description":"SQ domain"},{"type":"Modified residue","start":956,"end":956,"description":"Phosphoserine"},{"type":"Modified residue","start":1019,"end":1019,"description":"Omega-N-methylarginine"},{"type":"Modified residue","start":1089,"end":1089,"description":"Phosphoserine"},{"type":"Motif","start":1089,"end":1090,"description":"[ST]-Q motif 1"},{"type":"Modified residue","start":1107,"end":1107,"description":"Phosphoserine"},{"type":"Motif","start":1107,"end":1108,"description":"[ST]-Q motif 2"},{"type":"Modified residue","start":1110,"end":1110,"description":"Phosphoserine"},{"type":"Modified residue","start":1127,"end":1127,"description":"Phosphoserine"}],"interfaces":{},"subunit":[{"topic":"Subunit","text":"Monomeric in solution (PubMed:10999600, PubMed:26138914). Forms a trimeric UPF complex where UPF2 bridges UPF1 and UPF3B; UPF2 contacts the N-terminal CH-rich domain of UPF1 and the N-terminus of UPF3B (PubMed:18066079). The trimeric UPF complex interacts with the EJC core complex (PubMed:18066079). Found in a post-splicing messenger ribonucleoprotein (mRNP) complex (PubMed:21419344). Associates with the exon junction complex (EJC) (PubMed:11546874, PubMed:16452507). Associates with the SGM1C complex; is phosphorylated by the complex kinase component SGM1 (PubMed:19417104). Part of a complex composed of SMG1, DHX34 and UPF1; within the complex DHX34 acts as a scaffolding protein to facilitate SMG1 phosphorylation of UPF1 (PubMed:26841701). Interacts with UPF2 via the CH-rich domain (PubMed:11073994, PubMed:11113196, PubMed:11163187, PubMed:19556969, PubMed:23275559). Interacts with UPF3A and UPF3B (PubMed:11163187). Interacts with EST1A (PubMed:12554878). Interacts with SLBP (PubMed:16086026). Interacts (when hyperphosphorylated) with PNRC2 (PubMed:19150429). Interacts with AGO1 and AGO2 (PubMed:17932509). Interacts with GSPT2 (PubMed:18447585). Interacts with isoform 1 and isoform 5 of ADAR/ADAR1 (PubMed:18362360). Interacts with SMG7 (PubMed:15721257). Interacts with ZC3H12A; this interaction occurs in a mRNA translationally active- and termination-dependent manner and is essential for ZC3H12A-mediated degradation of target mRNAs (PubMed:26000482). Interacts with CPSF6 (PubMed:19864460). Interacts with MOV10; the interaction is direct and RNA-dependent (PubMed:24726324). Interacts with SHFL; the interaction increases in the presence of RNA (PubMed:27974568). Interacts with UPF2 and DDX4; interactions are mediated by TDRD6 (PubMed:25220460). Interacts with DHX34 and PABPC1/PABP1; the interactions are RNA-independent (PubMed:25220460). Interacts with RBM46 (By similarity)"},{"topic":"Subunit","text":"(Microbial infection) Interacts with human T-cell leukemia virus 1/HTLV-1 protein Tax; this interaction inhibits the host nonsense-mediated mRNA decay (NMD)"}],"isoforms":[{"accession":"Q92900-2","name":"2","synonyms":[],"notes":[],"length":1118,"transcripts":{"ensembl":["ENST00000262803.10","ENST00000920693.1"],"refseq":["NM_002911.4"],"refseqProteins":["NP_002902.2"],"maneSelect":true,"decay":[],"onlyDecay":false},"segments":[[1,1,352],[353,364,766]],"edits":[{"start":353,"end":363,"original":"GNEDLVIIWLR","replacement":"","added":0}],"missing":11,"replaced":0,"novel":0,"foldedAbsent":0,"foldedMissing":0,"features":[[0,11,0]],"interfaces":{},"model":{"entry":"AF-Q92900-2-F1","cif":"https://alphafold.ebi.ac.uk/files/AF-Q92900-2-F1-model_v6.cif","meanPlddt":73.7,"plddt":[[0,89],[50,5],[70,3],[50,5],[0,13],[50,1],[70,2],[90,30],[70,4],[90,9],[70,3],[90,9],[70,4],[90,6],[70,3],[90,10],[70,4],[50,2],[70,4],[90,2],[70,8],[50,7],[70,5],[90,5],[70,3],[90,11],[70,2],[90,2],[70,5],[90,1],[70,4],[90,1],[70,2],[90,2],[70,2],[90,1],[70,13],[50,4],[70,3],[90,27],[70,12],[90,6],[70,7],[90,4],[70,2],[50,2],[0,1],[50,1],[0,1],[50,3],[70,6],[90,6],[70,5],[90,5],[70,8],[50,3],[70,2],[90,5],[70,6],[90,1],[70,2],[90,7],[70,5],[90,35],[70,11],[90,50],[70,1],[90,32],[70,9],[90,11],[70,7],[90,2],[70,1],[90,2],[70,12],[90,2